# Vercel Web Analytics Installation Report

## Summary
Vercel Web Analytics was **already installed and configured** in this project. No code changes were necessary.

## Verification Steps Completed

### 1. Documentation Review ✅
- Fetched the latest Vercel Analytics quickstart guide from https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/quickstart
- Confirmed the correct installation method for Next.js App Router projects

### 2. Package Installation ✅
- Package: `@vercel/analytics` version 2.0.1
- Already present in package.json dependencies
- Lock file (package-lock.json) is up to date

### 3. Configuration ✅
- File: `src/app/layout.tsx`
- Import statement: `import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/next"`
- Component placement: `<Analytics />` correctly placed within the `<body>` tag of the root layout
- Implementation follows official Next.js App Router guidelines

### 4. Build Verification ✅
- Successfully ran `npm run build`
- Build completed without errors
- All 23 pages generated successfully

### 5. Linting ✅
- Successfully ran `npm run lint`
- No errors introduced
